<title>CANADA: Canada to auction C$2.3 bln bonds due 2008.</title>
<headline>Canada to auction C$2.3 bln bonds due 2008.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government of Canada said it plans to auction on August 6 C$2.3 billion of bonds with an unspecified coupon maturing on June 1, 2008.</p>
<p>The Bank of Canada will buy at least C$345 million of the new bonds.</p>
<p>The bonds, which will be dated and delivered on August 15, pay interest on June 1 and December 1, the government said.</p>
<p>No bonds mature on August 15, 1997.  </p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
